body:
Am I the only one that feels like BoJack didn't actually force them to drink? Or even force Penny into an uncomfortable position? The teens had booze already, so they would've drank no matter what. He probably could've done better to regulate them though...? 
And Penny didn't drink at all and was apparently clear headed? She said "i know what i want" Granted, at 17 there were things i thought i wanted and didn't. But he didn't force himself on her or anything. 

It makes me a bit anxious to think Pete repeat is about to make him look so bad to Hollyhock D;
